{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.description":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.description","source_hash":"802195327a40e9aea9d2fa639580e7809bd06ffae04080cced236930a384d118","translation":"使用 2026 僱主繳費區費率估算挪威年度工資成本,並根據明確的假設加上假期工資、養老金、應納稅工資和其他成本。"},"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.details":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.details","source_hash":"8b288037e5ace5a06c2ac3508b1fb5530ef3639d3532d57a8cec85bb4567058f","translation":"計算器使用公佈的2026區域稅率計算普通活動或農業/漁業的繳款基數,並加上已輸入的假期工資、應納稅補償金和任何養老金繳款。 對於Ia區的普通活動,將850,000挪威克朗的每個企業差額津貼適用於已輸入的本年度已使用的金額。 結果是年度規劃估計數;僱主的註冊地點和活動決定適用的規則。"},"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.example":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.example","source_hash":"f30c769371f3acb43827634a4b139057c36d7da182d30717c996a403dd1b0030","translation":"輸入年度工資總額,選擇用人單位登記的繳費區和活動型別,然後加上假期工資、養老金和其他補償。 例如,I區的繳費基數為1,000,000挪威克朗,則用人單位繳費基數為141,000挪威克朗,則用人單位繳費基數為14.1%。"},"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.fields.totalResult":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.totalResult","source_hash":"83cc4ca547abddd59ddda04c7568f1ab5ebcbce14e8dea8a43af8f39a46415bb","translation":"估計年度僱主費用"},"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.fields.zoneIa":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.zoneIa","source_hash":"ad01c947bfcd70b7f90ff1412a2adb63e54c298957cce429e8bfed0f8968f90d","translation":"第Ia區 — 14.1% 普通/10.6% 農業和漁業"},"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.related":{"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.related","source_hash":"3da6e153ee8cea08506a33e168e7b5e25fbdf546dcd75c3aeb3fa4345774f329","translation":"相關工具"}},"locale":"zh-TW","missing":["norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.name","norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.title","norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.intro","norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.exampleHeading","norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.howItWorks","norway-employer-cost-calculat